# The collector's launchd environment file. It normally lives in $HOME, where .gitignore has no
# say at all -- these two lines exist ONLY for the case a copy is dropped in the repo, which is
# what an operator following the install runbook is most likely to do by accident. Note that
# `.env.*` above does NOT match it: that pattern needs a leading dot before `env`.
.marketplace-collector.env
marketplace-collector.env
*.log
